      "statement": "In GUARD-MAIN, the start permissive is granted only in AUTO mode with the access door closed and the light curtain clear."
    },
    {
      "gold": "ILG-R02",
      "statement": "In GUARD-MAIN, the start permissive is withheld in manual mode regardless of guard state."
    },
    {
      "gold": "ILG-R03",
      "statement": "In GUARD-MAIN, an open access door denies the start permissive even in AUTO mode."
    },
    {
